            "sid": "JOS 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwondũ wa ũu ana ma Isilaeli matitonya kũũngama mbee wa amaitha moo; nĩmonetye amaitha moo mĩongo, nĩkwĩthĩwa nĩmaumanĩwa: ndikethĩwa vamwe nenyu ĩngĩ, ate o mwaananga kĩla kĩndũ kĩvathĩtwe kyume katĩ wenyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
