        },
        {
          "text": "Na Yosua akũlya, Ũtũthĩnĩtye nĩkĩ? Yeova nũnũũkũthĩn’ya mũthenya ũũ. Na Isilaeli onthe mamũkimanga na mavia; na mamavĩvya na mwaki, na kũmakimanga na mavia. ",
          "type": "text",
