        {
          "text": "Na moomba ĩũlũ wake mbumbu nene ya mavia, kũvika ũmũnthĩ; na Yeova aeka wai wa ũthatu wake. Kwondũ wa ũu syĩtwa ya vandũ vau yeetwa, Mwanda wa Akoli, kũvika ũmũnthĩ. ",
